        "CompMethodAdminDesc": {
            "name": "The review discusses and compares various methods of hydrogen administration, including inhalation, oral ingestion of hydrogen-rich water, intravenous injection of hydrogen-rich saline, and topical application, highlighting their relative efficacy and bioavailability in both animal and human studies.",
